    "ticket_merge": "same-mission and same-mode ticket segments separated by a short recovery are merged into one maintenance incident",
    "graded_log": "retain all raw events; merge same-context and same-mode segments within five seconds; only formal thrust-loss and no-output tickets enter the operator attention queue"
